an you put that in the, um, the Libor's cauldron album?\"], [\"Could you tell me the actual password for the club, please?\", \"On another note, could you please show me photos of Thavmoara?\", \"Would you mind adding it to the Libor's cauldron album?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0016\", \"v\": [[\"umm how much did I, uh, spend back in June?\", \"oh and what've I got on while I'm, um, away in Locarno?\", \"actually, scrap that, I'll just check it myself later\", \"ok and um can you settle up with Drondel in the boskice fund?\"], [\"Could you tell me how much I spent back in June, please?\", \"Separately, would you let me know what I have on while I'm away in Locarno?\", \"Actually, never mind that — I'll look it over myself later.\", \"Could you please settle up with Drondel in the boskice fund?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0017\", \"v\": [[\"when am i next seeing Przemek Halow\", \"move both of them to friday pls\"], [\"Could you tell me when I'm next seeing Przemek Halow?\", \"Would you mind moving both of those to friday, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0018\", \"v\": [[\"Could you check whether I have any mothball photos, please?\"], [\"got any mothball photos?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0019\", \"v\": [[\"whos gonna be at the look\", \"who else is coming apart from Drolette\", \"the Nerys one, when's their bday\", \"diff thing, bump the repair an hour later\", \"can u show me the Kally holiday card entry\"], [\"I'm trying to work out how many chairs to set out, so who's actually going to be at the look?\", \"I already knew about Drolette, so who else is going to be there apart from Drolette?\", \"I've got a feeling it's coming up and I really don't want to miss it again — the Nerys one, when's their birthday?\", \"Unrelated, but I'm running behind on everything, so could you bump the repair an hour later?\", \"Also, I'm writing out cards and wanted to check what I'd noted down — could you show me the Kally holiday card entry?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0020\", \"v\": [[\"find the insurance entry in my locker\", \"ok show me the password\"], [\"I've got some renewal stuff to sort out, so could you find the insurance entry in my locker? Just the entry itself for now.\", \"Right, I'm actually going to have to sign in, so could you show me the password for it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0021\", \"v\": [[\"whats the actual password for the insurance\", \"diff thing, show me the docs i starred\", \"the redcurrant task is done\", \"no wrong one, i meant the fix one\"], [\"I'm stuck on the login page and it's completely gone from my head, so what's the actual password for the insurance?\", \"Unrelated, but I flagged a few documents a while back — could you show me the ones I marked with a star?\", \"Oh, and I finally got round to it, so you can mark the redcurrant task as done.\", \"Sorry, I think I confused myself there — that was the wrong task, I actually meant the fix one.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0022\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you pull up my, uh, my university friend's contact?\"], [\"can i get my university friend's contact\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0023\", \"v\": [[\"March photos\", \"book Wengen Garden Centre on their site for tomorrow\", \"first one — which album?\"], [\"umm can you show me my photos from, uh, March?\", \"oh and can you, um, book Wengen Garden Centre on their website for tomorrow?\", \"ok well, the first one, um, which album's that in?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w23-0024\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you delete my, uh, my book task?\", \"oh and who did I have dinner with last tuesday?\", \"and, um, who's Nicanor?\"], [\"delete my book task\", \"who'd I have dinner with last tuesday\", \"who's Nicanor?\"]]}","ttft_ms":31312,"type":"result","duration_ms":46808,"uuid":"4dd5d06e-d8d1-48bc-a3b8-9d32dbae4519","ttft_stream_ms":1434,"time_to_request_ms":164,"first_content_frame_ms":1435,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22257667,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278808085.8374,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
